      "text": "\"Å rydde av bordet\" is \"to clear the table\". The little word \"av\" belongs to the verb and stays after it: \"Jeg rydder av bordet\". Norwegian has many such pairs (a verb plus a short word like \"av\", \"opp\", \"ut\"); you meet them as whole units.",
